---
layout: default
title: Freediving for kids
---

<div class="page mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 mt-0 text-balance text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-7xl">Calm starts young.</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-slate-100 sm:text-2xl">Children learn to float, swim, glide and dive with an instructor beside them, one skill at a time.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="grid gap-x-14 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">The dive reflex starts in the pool.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Hold your breath with your face in the water and your heart slows down by itself. The same response that keeps a diver calm at depth settles a child before a test at school.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Posture and lung capacity.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Regular sessions straighten the back and train the lungs to take in more air.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Focus that holds.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Underwater a child has one job, and attention turns calm and sharp.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Swim and dive safely.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Kids learn to swim on the surface, dive under and come back up safely.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">A love of the water.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">The sea is alive. Kids learn to care for it and leave it as they found it.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">One instructor, one child.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Your child gets my full attention and sets the pace. Pool first. Open water once the basics are calm and automatic. We take as long as it takes.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Progress you can see.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Kids set small goals and hit them. A longer float. A cleaner duck dive. A quiet recovery after a hold.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Parents stay in the loop.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">After each session I tell you what changed: comfort in the water, focus, recovery. You always know how your child is doing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a href="https://instagram.com/nofinsfreediving" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn mt-16">Let&rsquo;s freedive</a>
</div>
